interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0024","start":24,"end":25,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"柳季","kind":"person","person_id":"myy_zdg_6b6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"固定《論語註疏》卷15孔注明柳下惠展禽，疏並及柳下季；卷18士師三黜直道不枉之章對上子野兼廷尉正受代署牽連而免職、拒向有司申訟且終無恨意之完整語境。判同柳季，保原稱；不是依同名或單一候選自動配人。古注二十字五十字不作年齡資料。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0086","start":86,"end":88,"surface":"範縝","kind":"person","person_id":"fwc_fzf_pjh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"中書郎範縝未遇子野而聞行欲讓國子博士，梁030范縝同官同讓官事；範字不改。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"子野","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family:p016:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"其","kind":"person","person_id":"4ni_4t1_4o9_BB*AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"字幾原、父昭明、著宋略、掌國史及中大通卒，梁030同字、同家系、同著述與朝事。"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanshi-033-pei-family","book_id":"b-nanshi-033","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi033-ws1554233"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-liangshu-030-peiziye","work_id":"w-liangshu","book_id":"b-liangshu-030","source_id":"s-liang030-ws1508510","source":{"title":"梁書/卷3